'' structs: destructor-only temporaries -- assignment of a literal and a hidden-pointer result (structs/temp-var-dtors.bas)
'' RFC 0018 V2 (P1): tiko MOVES a returned local and a temporary passed or assigned, so this count
'' is below fbc's 'A 3' -- on purpose (RFC 0018 §13).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/udt-dtor-only-temps.bas -o tests/codegen/udtdtoronlytemps.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/udtdtoronlytemps.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: A 2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: B 3
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: C 2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: D 2
